WEBVTT

00:16.580 --> 00:20.220
<b>Your eyes that look far
off into the distance</b>

00:20.220 --> 00:23.820
<b>They're listening to the
voice within your heart</b>

00:23.820 --> 00:27.810
<b>Embracing a still blue moon</b>

00:31.190 --> 00:34.730
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.730 --> 00:38.400
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:38.400 --> 00:42.360
<b>Illuminate the night
that dawns too soon</b>

00:45.740 --> 00:52.950
<b>Even alone, I want to
keep on believing in you</b>

00:52.950 --> 01:00.260
<b>It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir</b>

01:00.260 --> 01:03.890
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.890 --> 01:07.500
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.500 --> 01:14.770
<b>We'll meet here again
someday, if that's the truth</b>

01:14.770 --> 01:18.410
<b>What should we fix our gaze upon?</b>

01:18.410 --> 01:25.150
<b>The reality that I reached
out and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:25.150 --> 01:28.910
<b>Let it go, Let's believe in it</b>

01:38.860 --> 01:41.890
<b>Did she leave claw marks
on your back or something?</b>

01:43.130 --> 01:45.170
<b>You're sharp, gramps.</b>

01:45.170 --> 01:48.070
<b>Well, just another one of those
ways for a man to get by in life.</b>

01:50.070 --> 01:54.940
<b>Despicable. What does Lady Gyokumen
Koushu see in this man?</b>

01:57.180 --> 01:59.880
<b>If you love her so much, why don't
you get her to take you to bed?</b>

02:01.280 --> 02:04.550
<b>Or would you be the one to
take her to bed?</b>

02:07.560 --> 02:10.860
<b>You know, can I ask
you one question?</b>

02:12.890 --> 02:16.460
<b>Who are you living for?</b>

02:48.000 --> 02:50.930
<b>Sanzo! Sanzo!</b>

02:50.930 --> 02:54.200
<b>Sanzo! Hang in there, Sanzo!</b>

02:54.200 --> 02:57.910
<b>So noisy... I can hear you.</b>

02:57.910 --> 02:59.810
<b>Don't yell into my ear.</b>

03:01.810 --> 03:04.810
<b>Bastard! I've had enough
of your conniving tactics!</b>

03:04.810 --> 03:06.410
<b>Get rid of the poison right now!</b>

03:07.580 --> 03:08.980
<b>Like I'd do that.</b>

03:08.980 --> 03:10.790
<b>You want to die?!</b>

03:10.790 --> 03:12.690
<b>You couldn't kill me.</b>

03:12.690 --> 03:17.890
<b>I've eaten a Sanzo and gained
eternal youth and immortality.</b>

03:20.330 --> 03:23.790
<b>That's why you're the ones who
are going to die!</b>

03:30.370 --> 03:34.540
<b>That's impossible. I won't die!</b>

03:34.540 --> 03:37.140
<b>I'm not supposed to die...</b>

03:40.580 --> 03:44.310
<b>Damn it, you guys need
so much looking after.</b>

03:45.420 --> 03:46.760
<b>Sanzo!</b>

03:46.760 --> 03:49.180
<b>It's all right. He's only
lost consciousness.</b>

03:50.260 --> 03:52.090
<b>But we have a problem now.</b>

03:52.090 --> 03:56.130
<b>With the scorpion woman dead, our
means of getting an antidote...</b>

03:56.130 --> 03:59.760
<b>Damn, useless woman.
"I won't die," my butt!</b>

04:01.300 --> 04:04.640
<b>I suppose that means the eternal
youth and immortality legend</b>

04:04.640 --> 04:06.110
<b>is nothing more than
a fanciful tale.</b>

04:13.520 --> 04:15.210
<b>Hey, is he...</b>

04:16.480 --> 04:18.420
<b>...going to go berserk again?</b>

04:21.660 --> 04:25.920
<b>We're in the same situation
as when we fought Rikudo.</b>

04:26.860 --> 04:28.330
<b>Goku...</b>

04:32.170 --> 04:33.630
<b>Hakkai...</b>

04:35.800 --> 04:39.570
<b>What should we do? What
can we do to save Sanzo?</b>

04:43.550 --> 04:47.640
<b>Remember what Sanzo said?
That, "These guys won't die."</b>

04:48.280 --> 04:52.090
<b>So, we must live up
to that expectation</b>

04:52.090 --> 04:54.390
<b>with everything in
our power to do so.</b>

04:55.660 --> 04:58.820
<b>I see. Okay, I'll become stronger!</b>

05:02.200 --> 05:05.270
<b>One way or another, there's sure
to be something that can be done.</b>

05:05.270 --> 05:09.200
<b>Don't worry, there's no
way he'll die so easily.</b>

05:11.310 --> 05:14.470
<b>For now, our priority should
be to get to the surface.</b>

05:15.410 --> 05:18.650
<b>Yes, if we go back to the
village we visited yesterday,</b>

05:18.650 --> 05:21.050
<b>we might at least find some serum.</b>

05:21.050 --> 05:22.880
<b>It's a desert village after all.</b>

05:22.880 --> 05:26.180
<b>They should have precautions
against scorpion poisons.</b>

05:27.220 --> 05:31.420
<b>But where's the exit? We don't
even know where we came in.</b>

05:46.310 --> 05:48.180
<b>What is it?</b>

05:48.180 --> 05:49.840
<b>I just heard something collapse!</b>

05:50.550 --> 05:52.010
<b>It couldn't be...</b>

05:52.710 --> 05:55.050
<b>We're underground, aren't we?</b>

05:55.050 --> 05:56.420
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

05:56.420 --> 06:00.890
<b>And how did we get ourselves
out of that prison just now?</b>

06:00.890 --> 06:02.360
<b>By breaking through the wall.</b>

06:03.630 --> 06:07.360
<b>If a wall in the central area of the
underground were destroyed,</b>

06:07.360 --> 06:09.030
<b>what do you think would happen?</b>

06:09.030 --> 06:10.230
<b>What would happen?</b>

06:10.230 --> 06:12.690
<b>It would collapse under the weight
of the desert above and...</b>

06:17.010 --> 06:20.180
<b>Say these things earlier, damn it!</b>

06:20.180 --> 06:22.410
<b>I did advise against it at the time.</b>

06:26.550 --> 06:30.580
<b>We can't get out of this room now,
much less look for an exit!</b>

06:31.890 --> 06:34.080
<b>Isn't there a vent or
something somewhere?!</b>

06:38.130 --> 06:39.820
<b>That's right! I'd forgotten!</b>

06:41.100 --> 06:42.700
<b>What're you doing, Hakkai?!</b>

06:42.700 --> 06:44.530
<b>The Scriptures!</b>

06:44.530 --> 06:47.830
<b>The Maten Scripture and the
other Sanzo's Scripture...</b>

06:50.410 --> 06:53.700
<b>Found it! But it's just the
Maten Scripture.</b>

06:57.810 --> 06:59.400
<b>Hey, this doesn't sound good!</b>

07:00.550 --> 07:02.220
<b>The ceiling's going to cave in!</b>

07:02.220 --> 07:03.680
<b>Gojyo, hold on to this!</b>

07:20.640 --> 07:22.100
<b>What?</b>

07:23.440 --> 07:25.170
<b>Hakkai!</b>

07:25.170 --> 07:28.140
<b>Unfortunately, I can only
shield us from above,</b>

07:28.140 --> 07:30.700
<b>so please be careful not to
get buried from below!</b>

07:31.310 --> 07:32.780
<b>Be careful? But...</b>

07:34.880 --> 07:36.780
<b>Hakkai, you're going to get buried!</b>

07:56.910 --> 07:58.400
<b>Damn!</b>

07:59.370 --> 08:04.070
<b>I never thought flowing matter
could be so troublesome!</b>

08:08.980 --> 08:10.590
<b>Give it up, Hakkai!</b>

08:10.590 --> 08:13.610
<b>If you try to hold up against this,
you're going to burst a vein!</b>

08:14.220 --> 08:17.620
<b>That would be preferable to all
of us being buried alive here!</b>

08:21.400 --> 08:22.860
<b>I can't hold it off!</b>

08:23.460 --> 08:24.930
<b>Damn!</b>

08:43.320 --> 08:44.790
<b>A crimson gale?</b>

08:55.400 --> 08:56.600
<b>It stopped.</b>

08:56.600 --> 08:58.060
<b>You okay?</b>

09:01.770 --> 09:03.960
<b>More importantly, what
was that just now?</b>

09:07.140 --> 09:08.610
<b>Hakuryu!</b>

09:12.010 --> 09:13.910
<b>Were you waiting
here all this time?</b>

09:15.450 --> 09:18.350
<b>Waiting for us all this time
under the scorching sun?</b>

09:23.390 --> 09:27.300
<b>He looks pretty weak.
In his condition...</b>

09:27.300 --> 09:30.990
<b>Yes, it'll probably be impossible
for him to carry us.</b>

09:31.970 --> 09:33.430
<b>No way.</b>

09:35.540 --> 09:37.030
<b>Sanzo!</b>

09:40.780 --> 09:42.510
<b>Hey, Hakkai!</b>

09:42.510 --> 09:46.500
<b>Don't do reckless things
just to act cool, you idiot!</b>

09:47.480 --> 09:49.250
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

09:52.790 --> 09:54.650
<b>It makes me look pitiful.</b>

09:57.590 --> 09:59.490
<b>Gojyo...</b>

09:59.490 --> 10:01.120
<b>So, it was you people.</b>

10:06.270 --> 10:07.700
<b>Kougaiji!</b>

10:19.880 --> 10:22.680
<b>But when people change,
they certainly do change.</b>

10:23.380 --> 10:25.410
<b>That child named Goku...</b>

10:28.360 --> 10:31.330
<b>When he was brought to the
Heavens five hundred years ago,</b>

10:31.330 --> 10:33.850
<b>he was nothing more
than a little monkey.</b>

10:38.000 --> 10:40.660
<b>That's what makes living
creatures interesting.</b>

10:42.940 --> 10:46.460
<b>I hate things that don't change.
They're boring.</b>

10:47.340 --> 10:52.840
<b>Come to think of it, I think I've
said that to someone before.</b>

10:54.880 --> 10:56.350
<b>Kougaiji!</b>

10:59.490 --> 11:02.650
<b>What the hell are you
guys doing here?</b>

11:03.460 --> 11:06.550
<b>That crimson gale
was you, wasn't it?</b>

11:08.400 --> 11:11.130
<b>You saved us? Thank you.</b>

11:11.130 --> 11:14.830
<b>Don't get me wrong. I just
happened to be passing by.</b>

11:15.700 --> 11:18.040
<b>That's right! Sanzo...</b>

11:18.040 --> 11:21.380
<b>Sanzo's been poisoned by a
demon, and he's in danger!</b>

11:21.380 --> 11:22.680
<b>What?</b>

11:22.680 --> 11:25.650
<b>Isn't that apothecary girl with you?</b>

11:25.650 --> 11:27.980
<b>Yaone's not with us today.</b>

11:27.980 --> 11:31.520
<b>You guys met the demon
who lives in this desert?</b>

11:31.520 --> 11:33.890
<b>Yeah, but she's already dead.</b>

11:33.890 --> 11:35.990
<b>Hey, that demon should've had</b>

11:35.990 --> 11:39.190
<b>one of the Founding Scriptures
of Heaven and Earth.</b>

11:39.190 --> 11:43.630
<b>Did you guys come here to
look for the Scripture?</b>

11:43.630 --> 11:45.790
<b>Then I think you've wasted your time.</b>

11:46.400 --> 11:48.230
<b>Everything's been buried
under the sands.</b>

11:49.070 --> 11:51.010
<b>You'll just have to dig it out.</b>

11:51.010 --> 11:53.530
<b>We did recover the Maten
Scripture though.</b>

11:55.010 --> 11:56.480
<b>Things couldn't be worse.</b>

11:57.150 --> 11:59.150
<b>As soon as I'm assigned
to find the Scriptures,</b>

11:59.150 --> 12:00.620
<b>I bump into these guys.</b>

12:00.620 --> 12:03.680
<b>On top of which, the Scripture
is underneath this vast desert.</b>

12:06.290 --> 12:09.720
<b>No, there's one more Scripture.</b>

12:20.940 --> 12:23.540
<b>Hey, what're you going to do, Goku?</b>

12:23.540 --> 12:25.440
<b>I'm going to carry Sanzo.</b>

12:25.440 --> 12:26.910
<b>Stupid monkey!</b>

12:26.910 --> 12:29.610
<b>Carry him in this scorching sun
for who knows how many kilometers?</b>

12:29.610 --> 12:30.750
<b>It's not possible.</b>

12:30.750 --> 12:34.450
<b>But what choice do we have?
We don't have time, right?</b>

12:34.450 --> 12:36.250
<b>Hakuryu's no use.</b>

12:37.650 --> 12:40.620
<b>But I'm not going to let Sanzo die!</b>

12:44.190 --> 12:46.260
<b>What's precious to you...</b>

12:46.260 --> 12:49.630
<b>You should never let go of
what's precious to you.</b>

12:57.510 --> 13:00.370
<b>Yeah, that's right. I know.</b>

13:02.240 --> 13:05.210
<b>I can't go back now.</b>

13:07.780 --> 13:09.250
<b>Wait, Goku.</b>

13:10.550 --> 13:13.920
<b>The flying dragon we rode
in on is over that way.</b>

13:15.090 --> 13:18.750
<b>You could easily get to a
nearby town if you use it.</b>

13:19.330 --> 13:21.930
<b>I wouldn't mind lending it to you.</b>

13:21.930 --> 13:23.560
<b>However,</b>

13:23.560 --> 13:25.660
<b>that's only if you can kill me.</b>

13:30.340 --> 13:33.710
<b>If we win, we get the
Maten Scripture.</b>

13:33.710 --> 13:36.910
<b>If you win, the flying
dragon is yours.</b>

13:38.950 --> 13:40.410
<b>Let's finish this.</b>

14:00.270 --> 14:02.790
<b>Kougaiji, what's the matter?</b>

14:03.470 --> 14:05.270
<b>You're acting weird.</b>

14:07.380 --> 14:08.840
<b>Goku, look out!</b>

14:19.490 --> 14:21.590
<b>What're you hesitating for?</b>

14:21.590 --> 14:23.160
<b>Kougaiji...</b>

14:23.160 --> 14:25.030
<b>You better get it right.</b>

14:25.030 --> 14:27.390
<b>I'm your enemy!</b>

14:31.800 --> 14:33.900
<b>If you've got no will to fight,</b>

14:33.900 --> 14:35.890
<b>then we'll just take the Scripture.</b>

14:42.540 --> 14:45.240
<b>Don't you touch Sanzo!</b>

14:48.150 --> 14:49.750
<b>Sanzo!</b>

14:49.750 --> 14:53.980
<b>Goku, leave Sanzo to me and fight!</b>

14:55.220 --> 14:57.090
<b>Kougaiji's serious.</b>

14:57.090 --> 15:02.090
<b>He's probably fighting for
something very important to him.</b>

15:03.530 --> 15:05.430
<b>You can understand
that now, can't you?</b>

15:06.330 --> 15:09.300
<b>What it feels like to not want to
lose something precious to you?</b>

15:14.940 --> 15:17.910
<b>Kougaiji, you're fine with this?</b>

15:19.480 --> 15:21.610
<b>I'll have no more regrets.</b>

15:24.220 --> 15:28.120
<b>All right, then I won't stop you either.</b>

15:29.890 --> 15:31.360
<b>Watch out!</b>

15:35.130 --> 15:38.900
<b>Quit ignoring my presence
and move matters along.</b>

15:40.670 --> 15:42.100
<b>I'll feel neglected.</b>

15:44.410 --> 15:46.810
<b>Am I not enough of an opponent
for you, Sha Gojyo?</b>

15:48.140 --> 15:49.800
<b>Perfectly fine with me, Dokugakuji.</b>

15:50.650 --> 15:52.840
<b>Don't be shy! Take this!</b>

15:56.150 --> 15:58.480
<b>Kougaiji, leave this one to me! Go!</b>

16:21.310 --> 16:22.900
<b>Hey, Hakkai.</b>

16:23.780 --> 16:26.210
<b>Would you stop me
afterwards somehow?</b>

16:27.050 --> 16:28.980
<b>Goku, you're not going to...</b>

16:28.980 --> 16:31.490
<b>The way I am right now,</b>

16:31.490 --> 16:34.510
<b>I won't be able to kill him, so...</b>

16:35.620 --> 16:38.250
<b>But I can't lose, so...</b>

16:42.630 --> 16:43.960
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

16:43.960 --> 16:45.530
<b>Goku!</b>

16:46.370 --> 16:47.870
<b>What is this?!</b>

16:47.870 --> 16:49.770
<b>That stupid monkey!</b>

17:08.590 --> 17:12.990
<b>He took me away from that dark,
dark place without light.</b>

17:14.460 --> 17:19.260
<b>He gave me a world much, much
more brilliant than the sun.</b>

17:20.870 --> 17:22.800
<b>Why is it?</b>

17:22.800 --> 17:24.270
<b>I remember it clearly.</b>

17:25.610 --> 17:27.540
<b>I've known</b>

17:27.540 --> 17:29.010
<b>this feeling...</b>

17:30.440 --> 17:34.380
<b>...from a much more distant past.</b>

17:36.650 --> 17:38.120
<b>I don't want to lose it!</b>

17:50.600 --> 17:52.400
<b>Goku? This is?</b>

17:55.600 --> 17:57.070
<b>This is...,This is...</b>

17:58.570 --> 18:00.040
<b>...his true form.</b>

18:02.540 --> 18:03.980
<b>Son Goku!</b>

18:05.950 --> 18:07.410
<b>He disappeared?!</b>

18:14.090 --> 18:15.560
<b>What the heck was that?!</b>

18:16.190 --> 18:17.890
<b>He didn't disappear.</b>

18:17.890 --> 18:20.290
<b>We weren't able to see him,
because he was too fast.</b>

18:23.400 --> 18:25.230
<b>Damn it!</b>

18:25.230 --> 18:29.530
<b>He's most likely much faster now,</b>

18:31.210 --> 18:33.070
<b>incomparable to when
he fought Rikudo.</b>

18:34.410 --> 18:35.970
<b>I won't stand a chance
in a hand-to-hand fight!</b>

18:36.780 --> 18:38.240
<b>In that case...</b>

18:50.190 --> 18:51.660
<b>Kai!</b>

19:14.580 --> 19:16.050
<b>Goku!</b>

19:22.720 --> 19:24.380
<b>He banished the fiend I summoned?!</b>

19:40.210 --> 19:41.670
<b>Kougaiji!</b>

19:43.280 --> 19:44.740
<b>Goku!</b>

19:52.690 --> 19:54.780
<b>This isn't about fighting or anything.</b>

19:56.090 --> 19:58.850
<b>He's having fun.</b>

20:03.860 --> 20:05.300
<b>Sanzo...</b>

20:07.640 --> 20:09.660
<b>What would you think...</b>

20:11.070 --> 20:13.040
<b>...if you saw Goku like this?</b>

20:20.280 --> 20:22.880
<b>Who am I living for?</b>

20:23.780 --> 20:26.720
<b>If you can't answer it, then I'll tell you.</b>

20:27.890 --> 20:32.560
<b>All people say it's for
someone else's sake,</b>

20:32.560 --> 20:37.790
<b>but they all live and
die only for themselves.</b>

20:44.070 --> 20:50.480
<b>That's right, even sudden
tragedies come</b>

20:50.480 --> 20:55.850
<b>Looking good-natured,
without cause for suspicion</b>

20:55.850 --> 21:01.360
<b>Don't complain, just shut up</b>

21:01.360 --> 21:04.760
<b>And look up</b>

21:04.760 --> 21:10.560
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:10.560 --> 21:15.970
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:15.970 --> 21:21.310
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:21.310 --> 21:25.240
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:32.250 --> 21:35.890
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:35.890 --> 21:37.860
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:37.860 --> 21:41.960
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:41.960 --> 21:46.100
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:46.100 --> 21:48.800
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:48.800 --> 21:53.840
<b>Standing next to the taunt pressure</b>

21:53.840 --> 21:59.250
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

21:59.250 --> 22:04.690
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:04.690 --> 22:08.710
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
